# Testing

## No network in unit tests

Every Salesforce interaction is tested against recorded fixtures in `tests/fixtures/`.
Use `respx` to mock `httpx`. Live-org tests are marked `@pytest.mark.live` and skipped
by default.

## Design for testability

Separate pure logic from side effects (HTTP, disk, LLM). Prefer small units that do
not need massive mocks. Keep fixtures realistic and shared across related tests.
